{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29398","headline":"玄微先生 · 李商隐","name":"玄微先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙翁无定数，时入一壶藏。\n夜夜桂露湿，村村桃水香。\n醉中抛浩劫，宿处起神光。\n药裹丹山凤，碁函白石郎。\n弄河移砥柱，吞日倚扶桑。\n龙竹裁轻策，鲛绡熨下裳。\n树栽嗤汉帝，桥扳笑秦王。\n径欲随关令，龙沙万里强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}